{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/eok0r1hzjd3je2zbe18109dvnyc530b.mp3","text":"在下一场实验开始前，我可以与你做一些讨论。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/kvpqc84s93wcxem9mh3klfqr7ab8sxb.mp3","text":"你把太多时间放在了与研究无关的杂务上，博士。身为研究者，你应该明白，这只会阻碍你前进的脚步。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/tkw7rdh0f49asm9f7i1w4kct9k6l7br.mp3","text":"银灰的两个妹妹？嗯，我见过几面。......？你还希望我说些什么？我对那种活蹦乱跳又善变的生物没有研究，也没有兴趣。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/7ssz2pyl9lqnm5e26yap031kb225chg.mp3","text":"将被源石感染后的表现简单地定义为疾病，仅仅思考如何去“抑制”和“治疗”它，这是无知的人才会做的事，不要告诉我你也是这么想的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/qgqhqfxn4wf4ua9z0fro7iwi9bvo954.mp3","text":"闪灵，她居然也在这里......嗯？她是个优秀的学者，我们曾经有过一些合作，但她在某一天忽然消失无踪，仅此而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/nvnwsitnbckc6ebi2k1b7ekgcfzmtbe.mp3","text":"我并不是在为银灰服务，只是我们的目的有相交之处而已。当然，我并不否认，他的事业对雪境有着长远的意义。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/k2gq17ojgv6r3ob1wvj6ngl5sbg03w7.mp3","text":"获得我信任的最好方法，就是拿出你的真才实学，看来你已经明白了这一点，博士。我与银灰不同，我对任何感情方向的深入交流都没有兴趣。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/pko6lrulkiqb1j9nofjo1yd4320ylbj.mp3","text":"如果你足够了解银灰，就会知道他并不冷酷，从我的角度来说，他甚至有些优柔寡断......并且，这也是你的弱点，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/s80w026fkqrmlqs2l22i9mp9oqmv3z2.mp3","text":"你的事业和银灰一样，需要无数人的支持，但支持你的越多，你需要在乎的就越多。既然你已经没有办法不去在乎，那就小心别被自己绊倒，这是我唯一的忠告，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/gedx41uomcnqnakbx6e6qmsd2fdhbpu.mp3","text":"看来你对自己身体的管理有所欠缺，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/kds4ys8is1d631i5igdc1rp72cwnpoh.mp3","text":"罗德岛的博士，久仰大名，你可以叫我灵知，自从罗德岛与喀兰建立起关系后我一直想要见一见你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/0mnziwktolnb578spinusbep9zptfi3.mp3","text":"战斗只是手段，不过，既然有更有效率的方式，我并不介意学习。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/swfgj4wn5k7s6pbjtlfz0kysbdsba5a.mp3","text":"比起薪资，我更感兴趣的是罗德岛资料库的权限。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/5r8r5k8yo8rl7u52ksd9tq4pzu9z0dd.mp3","text":"如果罗德岛愿意抛弃一些底线，必然会获得远超现在的成果......不过，有银灰在前，我也并非不理解坚持的意义。呵，就让我也来助你们一臂之力吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/9bkzraw1xxaacdspvwarymyqfoj6ui7.mp3","text":"你运气很好，我刚做完实验。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/hxwftsgk03yegi756t7t54n8ud7oytd.mp3","text":"做好自己的事，其他我来处理。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/dm83isatxje5r6fqe3vse8wi80t57tg.mp3","text":"希望这次任务不是在浪费我的时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/bnztpudfs1godmyx7nygvq72r0t3d8f.mp3","text":"按照计划行事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/m7rnkv1vgt5sqs80qseww9pt0fkftvh.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/0f95kf7yo5yd2ns51c1htosgnj8ju2z.mp3","text":"你打断了我的思路，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/ooa15ibti1dm24fyupnjtc00jnmr3uq.mp3","text":"不错的选择。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/63czraoix1asazta2f8523npydyjukw.mp3","text":"速战速决吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/50an3a19u7y3zr7fi6vbzno70n55iqe.mp3","text":"如我所料。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/2dl7ovb0ti9rwf3myjj1udscj7zmxam.mp3","text":"我有一个想法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/1515zmvn4ib2wrr2kbvuf4c0o4emzp5.mp3","text":"你们太吵了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/ks5oh7v9p86741inhv1nob2efqtjgux.mp3","text":"不要打扰我思考。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/f6u2yiegbw63b1c6egi3htr9b6dc6rj.mp3","text":"我很期待在科研方面也能看到你这样精彩的表现，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/mxnglgwlcivxzpcmzr8itk6ep5vt8n6.mp3","text":"做好先期工作，获得这样的结果只是理所当然。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/svzvoyl0m885e0bjsfk5c3qaeuzp8z4.mp3","text":"有些时候，发生意外反而会有所收获。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/ge2mdx94k786d1ymbj53j8ab5vv45hu.mp3","text":"不可控的变量太多了吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/b1n5vfzea26s4n3truy3evwtjis8bu5.mp3","text":"该去实验室了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/sw6vbev9e9vvmdcegne1uhhhko6zfer.mp3","text":"喂。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/j4i9qyzianm3myrrq9ovkdp5uuta9q8.mp3","text":"我有些新的想法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/rjvb2ypfmrh5endi6cmo5w9fopwmcg6.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/8f714ieyuiilm58jwwire3r18rs6tt8.mp3","text":"以我在谢拉格的经验来看，今天会是吵闹的一天......博士，我还有实验要做，就先失陪了，作为报酬，我会给你提供一些新的研究成果。以及，姑且说一声，新年快乐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/jwn0y5lf5hm77rdgeur4zyh9himgio0.mp3","text":"你应该更好地利用时间，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_206_gnosis/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/khfixdwj0ng7vqxu3191twh9vtmsdx5.mp3","text":"在下一场实验开始前，我可以与你做一些讨论。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/82u8qc39tuqqobry2ucb6bdkzh1wmax.mp3","text":"你把太多时间放在了与研究无关的杂务上，博士。身为研究者，你应该明白，这只会阻碍你前进的脚步。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/1zq32tt92b4ceihzyb29h2163exvlbt.mp3","text":"银灰的两个妹妹？嗯，我见过几面。......？你还希望我说些什么？我对那种活蹦乱跳又善变的生物没有研究，也没有兴趣。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/49/nu84jo3lpxtdno1h3uih3x2debnfajp.mp3","text":"将被源石感染后的表现简单地定义为疾病，仅仅思考如何去“抑制”和“治疗”它，这是无知的人才会做的事，不要告诉我你也是这么想的。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/oxu471b5mcudhd4vfphhzgbeknt85y6.mp3","text":"闪灵，她居然也在这里......嗯？她是个优秀的学者，我们曾经有过一些合作，但她在某一天忽然消失无踪，仅此而已。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/24ct8jfedyfullbb7tcj6x17fhgjb0v.mp3","text":"我并不是在为银灰服务，只是我们的目的有相交之处而已。当然，我并不否认，他的事业对雪境有着长远的意义。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/lwify6778nz81vp15y9epy3h8t8n3la.mp3","text":"获得我信任的最好方法，就是拿出你的真才实学，看来你已经明白了这一点，博士。我与银灰不同，我对任何感情方向的深入交流都没有兴趣。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/ejfv9ixa4x2qp3u8f2hoa2jws3ndwe2.mp3","text":"如果你足够了解银灰，就会知道他并不冷酷，从我的角度来说，他甚至有些优柔寡断......并且，这也是你的弱点，博士。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/11/rin4n1hpdql5vwotthxn42ry6ki8iaq.mp3","text":"你的事业和银灰一样，需要无数人的支持，但支持你的越多，你需要在乎的就越多。既然你已经没有办法不去在乎，那就小心别被自己绊倒，这是我唯一的忠告，博士。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/ib2hk68gn424koa9ix32szb1c0dluy9.mp3","text":"看来你对自己身体的管理有所欠缺，博士。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/d38tgyofr2u241uke5idkif5juhdgh2.mp3","text":"罗德岛的博士，久仰大名，你可以叫我灵知，自从罗德岛与喀兰建立起关系后我一直想要见一见你。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/kl152r1mf8n7iqip0ih3ptyaikzipxi.mp3","text":"战斗只是手段，不过，既然有更有效率的方式，我并不介意学习。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/1ed087ctbfbkwid5vzutwfbqeom6p7t.mp3","text":"比起薪资，我更感兴趣的是罗德岛资料库的权限。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/g7qwc2axnnaj1mm9jbrw31dlkj7o8lr.mp3","text":"如果罗德岛愿意抛弃一些底线，必然会获得远超现在的成果......不过，有银灰在前，我也并非不理解坚持的意义。呵，就让我也来助你们一臂之力吧。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/760kodtdns315oy6imohoy42is46kwv.mp3","text":"你运气很好，我刚做完实验。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/ju1y5wh66rj55x3gynkui1yzxq2tdij.mp3","text":"做好自己的事，其他我来处理。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/jicpvu69xdx51w23h5k451ifq66sffr.mp3","text":"希望这次任务不是在浪费我的时间。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/f34ncvy0beqpkmhk7xc30sw7qxfdvb9.mp3","text":"按照计划行事。","alt":"voice/char_206_gnosis/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/olosam4hapngh6igsdqri7w